  "title": "H-RIVALPARITY-1 part E (user-approved 2026-09-27) rerun of item C part 2: BEFORE/AFTER the host's own daily rebuild of the seller table WITH RivalClientSellers (default ON). Run T-RIVALSELLERS2-20260927-015913 (before part E) found that after the host's day-roll recount the client's Murray Hill liquor store / gym are no sellers on the host (their host copies have an EMPTY product list) - beer/whisky demand 43 -> 58. Now the host adds them from the client's self-report Selling list: after the roll the host's seller counts EQUAL the client's own local counts and the demand follows. READ-ONLY levers; NO save",
